   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "LoRA Manager \u2013 LoRA Loader Node Usage Guide",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Sending from LM UI to Workflow\n- **Click**: Append the selected LoRA(s) to the current LoRA Loader node.  \n- **Shift + Click**: Replace the current node content with the selected LoRA(s).  \n- **Color-code your target nodes**:  \n  If multiple valid target nodes exist, you can assign colors to them.  \n  LM will display these colors in the *Send to workflow* picker, making target selection easier.\n\n---\n\n## Text Input Autocomplete\n- Supports **multi-token search**, **case-insensitive**, and **token exclusion**.\n- Examples:\n  - `enhance low` \u2192 matches LoRAs containing **both** \u201cenhance\u201d and \u201clow\u201d.\n  - `detail -sdxl` \u2192 matches LoRAs containing \u201cdetail\u201d but **not** \u201csdxl\u201d.\n\n---\n\n## LoRA Widget Shortcuts\n### Navigation\n- **Arrow Up / Arrow Down** \u2014 Select previous / next LoRA.\n- **Ctrl/Cmd + Arrow Up** \u2014 Move selected LoRA upward.\n- **Ctrl/Cmd + Arrow Down** \u2014 Move selected LoRA downward.\n- **Ctrl/Cmd + Home** \u2014 Move selected LoRA to top.\n- **Ctrl/Cmd + End** \u2014 Move selected LoRA to bottom.\n\n### Editing & Deleting\n- **Delete / Backspace** \u2014 Remove current LoRA.\n- **Tab / Shift + Tab** \u2014 After confirming strength input, jump to next / previous editable field.\n\n---\n\nThese same features also apply to **LoRA Stacker**, **WanVideo LoRA Select**, and other LoRA Manager lora nodes.  \n"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
