   "title": "Prompt Node Usage",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Tag Autocomplete\n- **Type directly** to trigger tag autocomplete suggestions.  \n  Suggestions are based on **merged Danbooru + e621 tags**.\n- Use **category shortcuts** for faster searches, such as:\n  - `/character` \u2014 character tags  \n  - `/artist` \u2014 artist tags  \n  - Type `/` alone to see **more categories and available commands**.\n- Use `/ac` and `/noac` to **enable or disable autocomplete**:\n  - When autocomplete is **disabled**, `/` commands are still available for **category-specific tag search**.\n- Check **ComfyUI Settings** for additional autocomplete-related options.\n\n---\n\n## Embedding Search\n- Use the `/emb` command or the `emb:` prefix to search embeddings.\n- Supports **multi-token search** with **inclusion and exclusion**.\n- Examples:\n  - `/emb lazy pos` \u2192 matches embeddings containing **both** `lazy` **and** `pos`.\n  - `emb: lazy -neg` \u2192 matches embeddings containing `lazy` but **excluding** `neg`.\n"
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
