   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## NoobAI anime characters\n\n1. **Positive prompt**: tags in this order: quality \u2192 1girl/adult \u2192 hair \u2192 eyes \u2192 face \u2192 outfit \u2192 accessories \u2192 pose/framing \u2192 background \u2192 lighting.\n2. Keep `adult woman, mature female` in the positive and `child, loli, young, petite` in the negative.\n3. **Same character, new scene**: keep the hair/eyes/outfit tags identical, change only pose/background.\n4. **LoRAs**: open **/loras** in a new tab (same address as ComfyUI), download from CivitAI there, then click a LoRA to send it to the *Lora Loader* node. Use LoRAs whose Base Model is *NoobAI* or *Illustrious*.\n5. Settings: 832\u00d71216, euler_ancestral, normal, 28 steps, CFG 5.5.\n6. Outputs save to `output/noobai/` (and auto-backup to B2 if set up)."
